  "slug": "mediamtx-moq-length-allocation",
  "title": "A length field is not an allocation budget",
  "description": "MediaMTX trusted compact MoQ length fields as slice sizes before checking whether the message could contain that much data. A small unauthenticated input could trigger an unrecoverable allocation panic and stop the entire media server.",
